    {
      "id": "dee9a164-1a24-419b-8cc6-24eb2d8b961e",
      "title": "Escute e leia a frase. Observe a abertura educada antes da preferência.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 7,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "4b0b0c60-3168-4056-b013-0c46606fa7f8",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora observe um ajuste prático de chegada.</p><p><strong>Si es posible, prefiero una habitación en un piso alto.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Se for possível, prefiro um quarto em um andar alto.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/78c75fb15ca74d1290740cdef2dade7f_l04b06-si-es-posible-prefiero-una-habitacion-en-un-piso-alto.mp3?Expires=1794099623&Signature=gQTuFqwNYjI~P3bRUJiTepOTQvvecFIjOxQnNohqVgKhm2ZjvTBXRant1Zu3HFmbYOLC93i4yJ~6mNSLn93YumFsm2qRxvDX7hG131hZeXIp8RQEziA3qBN~DYw5iLHTnKbYTc-Ki2WU9SNx7TWQRXoL3rtK9i~I4Yxv9vzDClcaBF0BhmjUFVI4Xelo2eFi5g6hg7hxHEL~QW4g9eibS44ucVpMzXSfWO4FjP2SubfMzD6ZZ92LsdyXeWoitOD5LXZu23kL5KTbgetg2Z4hfshZNkyaxdElii73iffoNyoSWy4~~no-Xp7o3hT8~bxE-W4OJfQi6I4LMVxfu3gyKg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "aed2a588-ede0-4174-9629-5159d9a26fe5",
      "title": "Leia a nota e observe como a preferência aparece depois da abertura educada.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 8,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "e0c6d7e3-9d4a-49d5-83b7-91fb887ad054",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Si es posible...</strong> suaviza o pedido e mantém o tom educado na recepção.</p><p>Depois dessa abertura, você diz a preferência concreta, como <strong>una habitación en un piso alto</strong>.</p><p>Assim, o ajuste soa claro sem virar reclamação antecipada.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "5ffc88d8-a6a1-4d5d-b011-2d5a16e3265e",
      "title": "Passe pelos quatro cartões e observe como eles montam um check-in curto de verdade.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 9,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "a4f3a700-1089-498b-944c-81d427305781",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Tengo una reserva a nombre de Alex Vera.</strong></p><p>Use esta linha para abrir o check-in e localizar a reserva logo no começo.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/72f26cd6f7fd4ff7a093d2226d900e14_l04b02-tengo-una-reserva-a-nombre-de-alex-vera.mp3?Expires=1794099623&Signature=2DtZhlyMNfliNZ1ne2sgt2ppZGF-w9pi3xB6ieLN0P05ydyUsMszCuV7S92dlpzx3Liy~rlQHcPIespwAKjoxPybIJrkNv1gje2zG4wAmYs2U~NcW~EWMxwGcKltCrEIBAouszih-RgjdykOfGiPCC~02QWadKAXu0Qn8RZdrdh~bGzPzS~xKrd~latovesUdl6TTL-e43diXf1krKuT0e0WqcJzqXMe2jLIzrnwcn7HZFmFZFqI0Jfql0RcXHq1pftW2I0OgezvfApL~zRGlqUNMWwXyMYlgmqt5JtjDJ-YKhD57ngCT5iFdmsxn~4rLrt4zR66ysQm23Bqxwyxjw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "d636677e-69fb-4a64-b627-3d34b7f1236e",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Aquí tiene mi pasaporte.</strong></p><p>Ela ajuda a entregar o documento principal sem alongar a interação.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/afb40f8b918e4b6080c9b6ab3475bb2d_l04b04-aqui-tiene-mi-pasaporte.mp3?Expires=1794099623&Signature=0iMwyo-QK53JdiMARuLii4~fQSM4Bso8suuLdRcAJnHcqrSHV8lrwxzS7HXi6hYWnI9IuIJnIRaiuzD4cMF6ZOnz-h59JvKBCgEqAw7tWve1PCcVq3fJm0SA0ZN6Fxkpgr0tMp-a2gLFtlsZZ657Py3UXH8zBfrXN2H5HLtEbLdrd9ml3Pjfd7mNmMUGHC6cZdZaaWeSLCv91zzlOTYLVHsKX1BiwbJZR7PojUExw46V7iV5AHeWe73Vi~akLqPr0NxIbkrdn0Vgxi4hwNhohBbIGdyQh0~Bg8R4QGCQCKvMDs9YSDE~p4fwX0lxCKIQj7FN9GevE4S38tVhP~JGPg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "e28c5d75-47a4-4c01-a27c-1d1562b98886",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Tengo aquí el número de reserva.</strong></p><p>Ela entra quando a recepção precisa confirmar mais um dado da estadia.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/3da06dcbb5784790a103182609d3534f_l04b05-tengo-aqui-el-numero-de-reserva.mp3?Expires=1794099623&Signature=NPrje6ExSI-qammNi10UHo7bosgX7-T--qH8i4GFszLEUEP3u4ol6RU1FoPaAPjUwRGHngmsPT8EczQy~VunTYw4gPdleVH9fYispjUf5SyGG5XfV6dyl~gWF0zt~8bhhMSR3iCi9WtR5PAzHItIkgxQhTpJkXLWLgQZ2Rr7Hq6lLZWnBVsizjnDDKFIHqmdTq8nS~gglHTWyp9NqNiwCoO8n3Pg8Np97Fyo0zXQKCRJX8nGWq17jQUIyXP3T3dTKqKXersRmnhQItAi1xNMiqEKR3UiUUVM0k-Yw-M4pgTtfORRbbcV8-chmVBpr62FBZdvPA46nOZs5uzgsYxe3Q__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "845eaa7b-89bf-45de-9f06-3dd261adbf5d",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Si es posible, prefiero una habitación en un piso alto.</strong></p><p>Ela permite pedir um ajuste prático na chegada com clareza e educação.</p><p>Esse pequeno roteiro funciona em check-in de lazer ou de trabalho, quando você precisa chegar, confirmar e ajustar algo sem transformar a conversa em reclamação.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/78c75fb15ca74d1290740cdef2dade7f_l04b06-si-es-posible-prefiero-una-habitacion-en-un-piso-alto.mp3?Expires=1794099623&Signature=gQTuFqwNYjI~P3bRUJiTepOTQvvecFIjOxQnNohqVgKhm2ZjvTBXRant1Zu3HFmbYOLC93i4yJ~6mNSLn93YumFsm2qRxvDX7hG131hZeXIp8RQEziA3qBN~DYw5iLHTnKbYTc-Ki2WU9SNx7TWQRXoL3rtK9i~I4Yxv9vzDClcaBF0BhmjUFVI4Xelo2eFi5g6hg7hxHEL~QW4g9eibS44ucVpMzXSfWO4FjP2SubfMzD6ZZ92LsdyXeWoitOD5LXZu23kL5KTbgetg2Z4hfshZNkyaxdElii73iffoNyoSWy4~~no-Xp7o3hT8~bxE-W4OJfQi6I4LMVxfu3gyKg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
